((date 2026-09-13) (slug deteriorating-breadth-long-gate)
 (hypothesis
  "Blocking NEW long admission while the five-state breadth read is Deteriorating (deteriorating_blocks_longs, #2755 / PR #2759, default-off, inert unless macro_config.breadth_direction.enabled) improves the 26y top-3000 PIT-2000 record convention. Motivation: the 09-04 yearly review's per-state P&L (Deteriorating-state entries -$604k / n=80, 29% win on the record) and the observation that nothing gates them (the macro gate blocks only Bearish; neutral_blocks_longs would also kill Recovering, the best cohort). Book anchor: Ch. 3 reads participation directionally (weinstein-book-reference.md s2.8); spine item 6.")
 (base_scenario
  "deteriorating-gate-2026-09-13: arm a3 = the a0-breadth-on-null spec (record convention + breadth_direction ON) + deteriorating_blocks_longs true, salts 0/1/2 on _v10dedup 2000 (build 31e4bb9c3, pinned worktree sweep-detgate), paired against the committed a0-v10 null cells of stop-width-by-state-2026-09-08 (build 969637974; runtime-inert delta by inspection: #2759 flag-off pinned bit-identical, #2758 build-time only, #2750 validator only). Pairing gate validator_diff -check V6 exit 0 at every salt, V6 = 0 on all six cells. Pre-registered binary rule from #2755: clears only if realised P&L AND maxDD both improve at >= 2 of 3 salts; no per-state value search (cohorts below the 230-trade floor).")
 (window_id top3000-2000-2026-record-26y-3salt) (baseline_label record-breadth-on-null-v10dedup)
 (variants
  (((label null-a0-v10dedup-s0) (config_hash gate-off-breadth-on)
    (aggregate (((mean_sharpe 0.4453) (mean_calmar 0.1629) (mean_return_pct 382.74) (mean_max_drawdown_pct 37.60)))))
   ((label gate-a3-v10dedup-s0) (config_hash gate-on-breadth-on)
    (aggregate (((mean_sharpe 0.3250) (mean_calmar 0.0000) (mean_return_pct 179.91) (mean_max_drawdown_pct 39.62)))))
   ((label null-a0-v10dedup-s1) (config_hash gate-off-breadth-on)
    (aggregate (((mean_sharpe 0.4272) (mean_calmar 0.1676) (mean_return_pct 311.75) (mean_max_drawdown_pct 32.75)))))
   ((label gate-a3-v10dedup-s1) (config_hash gate-on-breadth-on)
    (aggregate (((mean_sharpe 0.3700) (mean_calmar 0.0000) (mean_return_pct 229.23) (mean_max_drawdown_pct 34.68)))))
   ((label null-a0-v10dedup-s2) (config_hash gate-off-breadth-on)
    (aggregate (((mean_sharpe 0.5260) (mean_calmar 0.1827) (mean_return_pct 639.74) (mean_max_drawdown_pct 42.96)))))
   ((label gate-a3-v10dedup-s2) (config_hash gate-on-breadth-on)
    (aggregate (((mean_sharpe 0.3358) (mean_calmar 0.0000) (mean_return_pct 197.90) (mean_max_drawdown_pct 40.04)))))))
 (verdict Reject)
 (notes
  "CLASSIFICATION: REJECT-do-not-revive for admission gating on the Deteriorating breadth state (experiment-flag-discipline.md Rule 4: retirement candidate after three sessions; flag stays default-off until then). calmar for the gate cells was not extracted (0.0000 = not read; see actual.sexp). WHAT THE DATA SAYS (V6 = 0 on all six cells): level -203 / -83 / -442pp; REALISED -$1.70M / -$0.82M / -$1.25M (0 of 3); maxDD worse / worse / better (37.6->39.6, 32.8->34.7, 43.0->40.0; 1 of 3, and the one win sits on the null's $3.84M open-MTM cell). Pre-registered rule fails on both criteria. WHY: Deteriorating fires on 52 of ~1,335 weeks - 6 in 2020, 20 in 2022-23 - i.e. inside fast recoveries and chop, exactly where the record's late-cycle monsters are bought: NVDA 2020-04-06 and UTHR 2020-12-02 are null-only at all three salts, BBWI 2020-08-08 at two, KLIC 2020-11-09 at one. Only 10-38 net entries disappear per salt but 290-330 later fills re-draw (blocking a week shifts every later fill), and the freed slots buy ordinary names (AEIS 2025, AN 2020, CLS 2023) that do not replace the tail. Exit mix moves TOWARD stops (s0: stop_loss 450->459, rotations 244->227) - the opposite of every lever that has helped. The gate is live in the sim (audit: long_top_n_admitted = 0 on every Deteriorating week; effectiveness table in the README). The 09-04 cohort read (-$604k) was below the 230-trade floor and is now paired-and-salted: removing the cohort costs 1.3-2.8x more than the cohort itself lost. FORWARD GUIDANCE: this closes the state-conditioning line from the 09-04 yearly review (per-state stop width = REJECT-as-default/keep-axis on 09-09; admission gate = REJECT-do-not-revive). Regime LABELS applied to admission are anti-predictive because the labels turn over inside the moves the edge comes from; entry-side work must be tail-preserving (funnel breadth, top-N, breakout-gate width), never a narrower admission by regime state. Same shape as project_cascade_selection_inversion and project_edge_is_the_fat_tail. Artifacts: dev/experiments/deteriorating-gate-2026-09-13/results/a3-deteriorating-gate-s{0,1,2}-v10-* (paired per salt against stop-width-by-state-2026-09-08/results/a0-breadth-on-null-s{0,1,2}-v10-*), read.sh = the paired read. Related ledger: 2026-09-09-stop-width-by-macro-state-surface (the sibling instrument), 2026-08-27-entry-rest-weeks-surface."))
